      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01417",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我充满幸福。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was filled with happiness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01417",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "在黑暗中，我整整生了一个钟头。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In the darkness, I lived for one whole hour.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01417",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我感到有生以来从不曾有过此时此刻这般幸福……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I felt that never in my life had I known happiness like this very moment...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01417",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我突然从黑暗中站起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I suddenly stood up from the darkness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
